{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/","title":"학정 EX-LE2","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 학정의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"학정 EX-LE2\n분류\n경외기혈 · 코드 EX-LE2\n위치\n무릎 위, 무릎뼈바닥(base of patellae) 중간지점 위의 오목한 곳.\n취혈\n무릎을 굽힌 후, 무릎뼈바닥 중간지점 위의 오목한 곳에서 취혈한다.\n자침·주의\n直刺 0.5～0.8寸\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_1","text":"경외기혈 · 코드 EX-LE2","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_2","text":"무릎 위, 무릎뼈바닥(base of patellae) 중간지점 위의 오목한 곳.","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_3","text":"무릎을 굽힌 후, 무릎뼈바닥 중간지점 위의 오목한 곳에서 취혈한다.","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_4","text":"直刺 0.5～0.8寸","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-FE2CED00EB9E42CA","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/ex-le2/","text_sha256":"0defacdfb1b8141bdbd50ba7ee1fe1e1cf0e0eb75d40ef20e060e8f13b8393bc","source_sha256":"f74b19500d7e8b367e561cb59418c09b793f993f77f178c7d65a4f948ca4e3ef","commit":"fa43e3a29613cc0dfdcf276cecbe71c1f3f21e7d"}}
